Package: microclimfPara
Type: Package
Title: microclimfPara: Fast above, below or within canopy gridded microclimate modeling with parallelization, based on work of Maclean 2026 'microclimf' 
Version: 2.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bryan", "Spencer", email = "bspencer@uidaho.edu", role = c("ctb", "cre")))
Maintainer: B. D. Spencer <bspencer@uidaho.edu>
Description: The functions in the microclimfPara package are based on the work of Maclean (2026) R package 'microclimf' and 
    are designed to run in parallel on gridded data. The package contains minor bug fixes, memory conserving improvements, and changes such as an option to 
    disable the subnivian routine. Parallelization was implemented via RcppParallel, and validated against the orignal microclimf pacakge.
